## Summary of Key Findings

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 1. **Healthy organic ecosystem**: Zero bots detected, all 1,500 users active, stable 12-month posting volume
> 2. **Engagement independence**: Likes/shares/comments are completely uncorrelated -- unusual for social platforms
> 3. **Follower count is irrelevant**: r = -0.011 with engagement; the platform is meritocratic
> 4. **Negative content is not penalized**: Negative posts outperform positive ones by ~2% in engagement
> 5. **Amazon highest engagement brand** (3,713.1 avg) despite fewer mentions than Adidas/Nike
> 6. **Arabic-language content** leads engagement quality (3,696.4 avg)
> 7. **~15% systematic data loss** across platform/text/likes fields -- investigate pipeline
> 8. **9 activity spike days** detected via 2-std-deviation threshold
